  "question": {
    "text": "A projectile of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is fired from ground with speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi></math> at an angle <math><mi>θ</mi></math> to horizontal. What is the power of gravitational force, when it makes an angle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>θ</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> with the horizontal?<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/urvsttrccbhflxnzmnoepgdabnwlvyzpfgdyupkrpybnsdwlvb.jpeg\" />",
